This licence covers the code in this repository only.

data/stability.txt is the NetMHCstabpan stability dataset of Rasmussen et al.,
J Immunol 2016;197(4):1517-24, doi:10.4049/jimmunol.1600582. It is redistributed
here under the terms of its original publication and is not ours to relicense.

site/3gsn.pdb.txt and site/3vri.pdb.txt are coordinates from the RCSB Protein
Data Bank and belong to their depositors.

Sponsor and event artwork in site/ belongs to the respective organisations and
to the hackathon organisers, and appears here only as event credit.
